@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route117/scripts.inc: Route117_Text_ArentTheseFlowersPretty
Hoenn_Route117_Text_ArentTheseFlowersPretty::
	.string "What do you think?\n"
	.string "Aren't these flowers pretty?\p"
	.string "I planted them all!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route117/scripts.inc: Route117_Text_AirIsTastyHere
Hoenn_Route117_Text_AirIsTastyHere::
	.string "The air is tasty here!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_DylanIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_DylanIntro::
	.string "I'm in the middle of a triathlon, but,\n"
	.string "whatever, let's have a battle!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_DylanDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_DylanDefeat::
	.string "I ran out of energy!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_DylanPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_DylanPostBattle::
	.string "I may have blown it…\p"
	.string "I might have dropped to last during\n"
	.string "that battle…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_LydiaIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_LydiaIntro::
	.string "Please, allow me to evaluate if you\n"
	.string "have raised your POKéMON properly.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_LydiaDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_LydiaDefeat::
	.string "Yes, they are growing properly.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_LydiaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_LydiaPostBattle::
	.string "Try raising POKéMON with more\n"
	.string "attention to their character traits.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_IsaacIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_IsaacIntro::
	.string "Listen, could I get you to battle\n"
	.string "the POKéMON I'm raising?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_IsaacDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_IsaacDefeat::
	.string "You've raised yours superbly…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_IsaacPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_IsaacPostBattle::
	.string "POKéMON isn't all about power.\p"
	.string "Polishing a unique aspect of one's\n"
	.string "character is another way of enjoying\l"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MariaIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MariaIntro::
	.string "I do my triathlon training with POKéMON,\n"
	.string "so I'm pretty confident about my speed.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MariaDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MariaDefeat::
	.string "I need to get more practices in,\n"
	.string "I guess.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MariaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MariaPostBattle::
	.string "Training is meaningful only if you\n"
	.string "keep it up regularly.\p"
	.string "Okay! I'll resume my training!\n"
	.string "Tomorrow!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_DerekIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_DerekIntro::
	.string "Once a BUG CATCHER!\n"
	.string "And now a BUG MANIAC!\p"
	.string "But my love for POKéMON remains\n"
	.string "unchanged!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_DerekDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_DerekDefeat::
	.string "My ineptitude also remains\n"
	.string "unchanged…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_DerekPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_DerekPostBattle::
	.string "All I did was follow my heart, and now\n"
	.string "they call me a BUG MANIAC…\p"
	.string "Still, I am an expert on BUG POKéMON,\n"
	.string "so it's only natural that they call me\l"
	.string "a BUG MANIAC.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MegIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MegIntro::
	.string "MEG: I'm going to tag up with my super\n"
	.string "senior student partner and beat you!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MegDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MegDefeat::
	.string "MEG: Oh, no!\n"
	.string "I'm sorry, ANNA! I let you down…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MegNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MegNotEnoughMons::
	.string "MEG: Do you only have one POKéMON?\n"
	.string "We can't battle with you, then.\p"
	.string "We want to have a 2-on-2 battle.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MegPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MegPostBattle::
	.string "MEG: I dragged ANNA down…\n"
	.string "If I didn't, she would have won!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_AnnaIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_AnnaIntro::
	.string "ANNA: I'm with my pretty junior student\n"
	.string "partner. I have to do good!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_AnnaDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_AnnaDefeat::
	.string "ANNA: I'm with my pretty junior student\n"
	.string "partner! Let me win!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_AnnaNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route117_Text_AnnaNotEnoughMons::
	.string "ANNA: If you want to battle us,\n"
	.string "bring two POKéMON with you.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_AnnaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_AnnaPostBattle::
	.string "ANNA: Your POKéMON have some good\n"
	.string "combinations.\p"
	.string "I'd say you're second only to us!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route117/scripts.inc: Route117_Text_DayCarePokemonHadNewMove
Hoenn_Route117_Text_DayCarePokemonHadNewMove::
	.string "I left my POKéMON at the DAY CARE.\p"
	.string "When I got it back, it had a new move\n"
	.string "that I didn't teach it.\l"
	.string "I was really, really surprised.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_BrandiIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_BrandiIntro::
	.string "Let me demonstrate the power\n"
	.string "hidden within a PSYCHIC POKéMON!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_BrandiDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_BrandiDefeat::
	.string "Astonishing!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_BrandiPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_BrandiPostBattle::
	.string "PSYCHIC POKéMON are complex.\n"
	.string "You should try catching some.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_AishaIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_AishaIntro::
	.string "Concentrate on getting the win.\n"
	.string "That's how I battle!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_AishaDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_AishaDefeat::
	.string "I don't waste any time being angry\n"
	.string "over a loss--I would rather train.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_AishaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_AishaPostBattle::
	.string "I think that if you worry about losing,\n"
	.string "you're more likely to lose.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MelinaIntro
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MelinaIntro::
	.string "Isn't it nice? To battle while looking\n"
	.string "at pretty flowers?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MelinaDefeat
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MelinaDefeat::
	.string "Oh, that's quite impressive!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route117_Text_MelinaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route117_Text_MelinaPostBattle::
	.string "It feels wonderful to go for a jog\n"
	.string "while looking at flowers.$"

